The `Benchmarks` route has been significantly improved with a robust, sortable performance leaderboard.

### Key Changes:
- **Comprehensive Stats**: Added columns for **# of Runs**, **Avg Duration** (total time), **Avg TTFT** (latency/time to first token), **Avg TPS** (tokens per second), and **Funny Score**.
- **Robust Sorting**:
    - **Default Sort**: The table now defaults to **Fastest Avg Duration** (total time), as requested.
    - **Interactive Headers**: You can now click any header to sort by that metric. It intelligently toggles between ascending and descending (e.g., Duration defaults to ascending/fastest, while TPS and Funny Score default to descending/highest).
- **Enhanced UI**:
    - **Sticky Headers**: The table header stays fixed while scrolling through many models.
    - **Performance Indicators**: Metrics are color-coded (Green for fast, Yellow for medium, Red for slow) to give you an immediate sense of performance.
    - **Rank Styling**: Top models in the default view receive special rank badges.
    - **Visual Stats**: Retained the funny/not-funny ratio bars and counts but integrated them into the new table structure.

The app already records these metrics during both the "Evaluation" and "Joke" modes, so the leaderboard will automatically populate as you run more tests.

